&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WE ARE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Adaptive, we’re the leading experts in custom trading technology solutions. We craft bespoke front-office platforms for financial services firms that want to own their technology, differentiate in the market, and keep innovating for the long term.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Through a unique combination of deep capital markets expertise and world-leading technology, we help clients build high-performance, resilient trading systems across asset classes and create lasting competitive advantage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At the heart of it is Aeron®, our open-source technology used by hundreds of market participants to build high-throughput, low-latency, resilient trading systems, on-premises and in the cloud. Together with our broader platform and accelerator capabilities, it helps clients move faster without compromising on performance, control or flexibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With offices in London, New York, Barcelona, Montréal, and Manila, we support firms globally. We’re expanding our marketing capability and looking for someone who can help turn that story into bold, commercially effective campaigns.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Integrated Campaigns Manager&lt;/strong&gt;: someone who thrives at the intersection of marketing strategy, campaign execution, technology and commercial growth. Someone ready to plan, shape and execute integrated campaigns across Adaptive and our product priorities, bringing both strategic thinking and the hands-on energy to see them through.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you love building bold campaigns, telling stories that resonate in a highly technical space, and working where marketing genuinely drives commercial impact, this is your invitation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Come build something powerful with us.&lt;/p&gt;
